<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Hi Team<br />
<br />
Good morning all,&nbsp;<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Please see the below pre alert.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
AWB 081-xxxxxxxx 01PAG 2000KG LV BEES NIL DRY ICE&nbsp;<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
QFxxxx / DDMMM&nbsp; &nbsp;city code-city code.&nbsp;<br clear="none" />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><u><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Loading requirements</span></span></u></span></span><br />
&nbsp;
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Qantas A332 ALM</span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Carriage of Live Bees</span></span></i></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Due to the ongoing heat generated by live bee shipments, the following limitations apply:</span></span></i></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Loaded On / In ULD</span></span></i></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="background:yellow"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Where possible, live bees shall be uplifted <u>in Compartment 2</u> and temperature requirements notified by Qantas Freight</span></span></span></i><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"> <b><span style="color:red">(4 Deg C).</span></b></span></span></i></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="background:yellow"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Heating-OFF</span></span></span></i></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="background:yellow"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">The optimum temperature for large shipments of live bees is around 2-5°C.</span></span></span></i></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="background:red"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:white">Do Not Load other animals in the same hold as Live Bees</span></span></span></span></i></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Loaded in Bulk Hold</span></span></i></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif">Reference Loaded on/ in ULD above.</span></span></i></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Kind Regards,</span></span><br />
<br />
